6. Functions of the Pakistan Rangers.– The Force shall perform the following functions:-
(a) protection of persons and property in the border areas;
(b) apprehension of persons unlawfully entering into or going out of Pakistan territory;
(c) organization of village defence in the border areas;
(d) prevention of smuggling * * *;
(e) collection of intelligence in the border areas ; and
(f) co-ordinate of the activities of Police and other civil agencies in the prevention and detection of smuggling.

